cat - copy files to standard output

SYNOPSIS
    cat [file ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Copy the named files to standard output in argument order. Read standard
    input if there are no operands or when an operand is a single dash.

EXIT STATUS
    The exit status is 0 on success or 1 on error.

EXAMPLES
    cat first second > both

SEE ALSO
    cp(1), head(1), tail(1), tee(1)
